WIRE.md §6.1 (DECISIONS 420): `load` follows load.dir's link bounds; a path that is a link whose
target resolves outside the declared roots and the project is E7004 ReadOutsideRoots, unread.
-- call --
load("lnk.json")
-- symlinks --
lnk.json ../outside/x.json
-- /outside/x.json --
{"a": {"label": "x"}}
-- findings.txt --
error[E7004]  call:1:1
  cannot read lnk.json: reached through a symbolic link outside the roots and the project

1 error, 0 warnings in 1 package (…)
